      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Structurally I think it would be better if this corresponded to a capability of the implementation and not to a specific class.\n\nI agree, but the required capacity is \"a cache based on the external-IDs blob which is stored in NoteDB\". I could make an interface out of it, with a single getter method similar to this one, but I\u0027m not sure it\u0027s more clear.\n\n\u003e In the current form, can\u0027t it be replaced by an \"instanceof\" check?\n\nUnfortunately not. Internally, this method will have some logic other than casting. I\u0027ll send you the internal change offline.",
      "parentUuid": "968276ef_75b423d4",
